# Use skills for feature work

When extending this backend, use the project skills so changes follow the same patterns.

- **Add a new entity/resource** (e.g. Product, Order): Use the **add-entity** skill. Invoke with `/add-entity` or rely on Agent Decides.
- **Add a new API endpoint**: Use the **add-route** skill (`/add-route`).
- **Add or change request validation** (body, params, query): Use the **add-validator** skill (`/add-validator`).
- **Secure a route** (JWT, roles): Use the **auth-and-routes** skill (`/auth-and-routes`).
- **Add a new repository** (new persistence or entity): Use the **database-repository** skill (`/database-repository`).

All skills live under `.cursor/skills/`. For project structure and conventions, the **backend-conventions** skill and the rule that applies to `src/**/*.ts` also apply.
